sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Istio Gateway (Envoy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ExtProc as ext_proc Server<br/>9004/TCP gRPC
    participant Guard as maas-headers-guard
    participant Resolver as model-provider-resolver
    participant Metering as external-metering
    participant Stream as stream-usage-enforcer
    participant Translate as api-translation
    participant AuthInject as apikey-injection
    participant NemoReq as nemo-request-guard
    participant MeterSvc as Metering Service<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant NemoSvc as NeMo Guardrails<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant K8sSecrets as Kubernetes Secrets
    participant Provider as LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+

    Note over Client,Provider: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    Envoy->>ExtProc: ProcessingRequest (headers)<br/>gRPC/9004, plaintext/mTLS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 230)
        Note over Guard,AuthInject: Request Plugin Pipeline (in order)
        ExtProc->>Guard: RequestHeaders
        Guard-->>ExtProc: Capture & strip x-maas-* headers
        ExtProc->>Resolver: RequestHeaders
        Note right of Resolver: Resolve model → provider<br/>Weighted selection (0-100)<br/>Set x-ipp-selected-provider header
        Resolver-->>ExtProc: Routing headers set

        ExtProc->>Metering: RequestHeaders
        Metering->>MeterSvc: GET /balance (budget check)<br/>Fail-open if unavailable
        MeterSvc-->>Metering: Balance response

        opt NeMo Guardrails enabled
            ExtProc->>NemoReq: RequestBody
            NemoReq->>NemoSvc: POST /input-rails<br/>Content safety check
            NemoSvc-->>NemoReq: Allow/Block (fail-closed)
        end

        ExtProc->>Stream: RequestBody
        Note right of Stream: Inject stream_options<br/>include_usage=true
        Stream-->>ExtProc: Modified body

        ExtProc->>Translate: RequestBody
        Note right of Translate: Translate API format<br/>OpenAI ↔ Anthropic ↔ Vertex<br/>↔ Bedrock ↔ Azure
        Translate-->>ExtProc: Translated body

        ExtProc->>AuthInject: RequestHeaders
        AuthInject->>K8sSecrets: Read credentials<br/>(label-filtered informer)
        Note right of AuthInject: Inject auth:<br/>Bearer Token (OpenAI)<br/>x-api-key (Anthropic)<br/>api-key (Azure)<br/>OAuth2 Bearer (Vertex)<br/>AWS SigV4 (Bedrock)
        AuthInject-->>ExtProc: Auth headers injected
    end

    ExtProc-->>Envoy: ProcessingResponse (mutated request)
    Envoy->>Provider: Forward via HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS (DestinationRule SIMPLE)<br/>Injected credentials

    Provider-->>Envoy: LLM Response (JSON/SSE)

    Envoy->>ExtProc: ProcessingRequest (response)
    rect rgb(230, 230, 245)
        Note over Translate,Metering: Response Plugin Pipeline
        ExtProc->>Translate: ResponseBody
        Note right of Translate: Translate response format<br/>back to client's expected format
        Translate-->>ExtProc: Translated response

        ExtProc->>Metering: ResponseBody
        Metering->>MeterSvc: POST /events (CloudEvents)<br/>Token usage reporting
        MeterSvc-->>Metering: Acknowledged

        opt NeMo Guardrails enabled
            ExtProc->>NemoSvc: POST /output-rails<br/>Response content check
            NemoSvc-->>ExtProc: Allow/Block
        end
    end

    ExtProc-->>Envoy: ProcessingResponse (mutated response)
    Envoy-->>Client: JSON/SSE Response

    Note over Client,Provider: Flow 2: ExternalModel Reconciliation

    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note right of K8sAPI: ExternalModel CR created/updated
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: Watch event (ExternalModel)
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: GET ExternalProvider<br/>(lookup referenced providers)
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: ExternalProvider details
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE HTTPRoute<br/>(Gateway API routing rule)
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: UPDATE ExternalModel/status<br/>(phase + httpRouteName)

    Note over Client,Provider: Flow 3: ExternalProvider Reconciliation

    Note right of K8sAPI: ExternalProvider CR created/updated
    K8sAPI-->>ExtProc: Watch event (ExternalProvider)
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: GET Secret (validate credentials)
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE Service<br/>(ExternalName)
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE ServiceEntry<br/>(Istio mesh registration)
    ExtProc->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE DestinationRule<br/>(TLS origination SIMPLE)
